  "prefLabel": "Ed 202.13 Office of legislation and hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 202.13 “Office of legislation and hearings” means an entity within the office of the commissioner that acts as agent for the state board or commissioner for the purpose of overseeing the resolution of disputes.\n\nSource. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05",
